<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '20px 70px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4, letterSpacing: 1 }}>03 / 单题引擎</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 32, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.3 }}>时间如何关联步骤，以及四种时间指标</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '7px 16px', borderRadius: 20, background: '#98A2B3' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 600 }}>待研究</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 532, paddingTop: 8, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 28, flex: 1 }}><Box style={{ width: 700, justifyContent: 'center' }}><svg width={700} height={330} viewBox='0 0 700 330'><line x1='40' y1='70' x2='660' y2='70' stroke='#E3E8EF' stroke-width='3'/><text x='40' y='46' font-size='16' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='start' font-weight='600'>步骤 1：列式</text><rect x='60' y='60' width='90' height='20' rx='4' fill='#1E7BE0'/><rect x='300' y='60' width='70' height='20' rx='4' fill='#1E7BE0'/><text x='40' y='140' font-size='16' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='start' font-weight='600'>步骤 2：化简</text><rect x='190' y='130' width='120' height='20' rx='4' fill='#00A9B5'/><rect x='420' y='130' width='100' height='20' rx='4' fill='#00A9B5'/><text x='40' y='214' font-size='16' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='start' font-weight='600'>步骤 3：求解</text><rect x='380' y='204' width='140' height='20' rx='4' fill='#0E2340'/><rect x='560' y='262' width='90' height='20' rx='4' fill='#7A8699' opacity='0.45'/><text x='605' y='250' font-size='13' fill='#7A8699' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>待确认</text><text x='350' y='300' font-size='15' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>一步可以关联多个不连续时段；不同步骤的修改时段可能交错</text><text x='350' y='324' font-size='14' fill='#E8A33D' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>不能简单累加时间跨度作为整题用时</text></svg></Box><Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 11, justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>对齐原则</Text><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>物理笔画、页面一行文字与逻辑解题步骤不严格对应：学生可能先算后补理由，也可能多次返回同一步。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>步骤归属不确定时应允许“待确认”，不强行把整页按行或按固定时间间隔切成标准步骤。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>短期可允许学生圈选确认或修正对齐结果；替代解法应保留自己的步骤路径。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>四类时间指标：实际书写时长、落笔间隔、某步骤首次出现到最后修改的跨度、整题经过时间。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>时间信息用于发现值得核实的片段，判断仍以内容为依据；写得慢不能直接判为不会。</Text></Box></Box></Box></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E3E8EF', marginTop: 8 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>依据：单题功能设计思路.md §3.4</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}> 28 / 124 </Text></Box></Slide>